Dear Brightwell team,

Summit Steel makes double wall stainless steel drinkware in Yongkang. Quote below, photos attached.

Item No.   | Description                                           | USD / pc (FOB Ningbo) | MOQ      | Production | Shipping
3SSHD010   | Leopard Rainbow Canyon Cup, 40 oz, straw, gift box    | 5.70                  | 600 pcs  | 55 days    | 40 days
3SSHD033TN | Tennessee Canyon Cup, 40 oz, straw, black, gift box   | 7.35                  | 1,000    | 65 days    | 30 days
3QC003     | In Bloom Quatre Chiller, stainless steel, silicone cap + slide lid tumbler | 3.90 | 2,000    | 35 days    | 35 days

Details
- 3SSHD010: size 5.86 x 3.93 x 10.7 in, weight 1.21 lb. Stainless steel body, plastic lid, ABS straw. Hand wash only. Colour box. Collection Cottage Garden, artwork EveArt, multicolour animal print rainbow.
- 3SSHD033TN: size 5.9 x 4 x 10.7 in. Stainless steel body, plastic lid and straw. Hand wash only. Colour box. Collection High Country, artwork EveArt.
- 3QC003: hand wash only. Colour box with window. Artwork EveArt, multicolour. Theme nautical.
- All items: double wall vacuum insulation, made in China.

Samples: USD 30 per item, refundable with order.
Compliance: FDA food-contact report and LFGB report on request.

Regards,
Ethan Zhang
Summit Steel Drinkware | Yongkang, Zhejiang

